<!doctype html><html lang="zh"><meta charset="utf-8"><title>巨石蛇断口 · 鞭状摆动</title>
<style>*{box-sizing:border-box}body{margin:0;background:#13090c;color:#e7c07a;font:15px system-ui}main{display:flex;justify-content:center;align-items:flex-start;gap:20px;padding:20px}canvas{height:calc(100vh - 40px);max-width:75vw;object-fit:contain;background:#16060b;border:1px solid #463022}aside{width:250px;padding:14px}h2{font-size:21px}p{line-height:1.8;color:#b7a48e}label{display:block;margin:18px 0}input[type=range]{width:100%}button{padding:9px 17px;background:#b88d4d;border:0;color:#13090c;border-radius:4px;cursor:pointer}small{color:#a18b76}</style>
<main><canvas id="canvas" width="1152" height="1400"></canvas><aside><h2>巨石蛇 · 断口摆动</h2><p>根部固定，下段先发力。弯曲沿链条向上传递，断口延迟跟随并甩出。</p><button id="pause">暂停</button><label>摆动频率 <output id="freqValue">0.78 Hz</output><input id="frequency" type="range" min="0.3" max="1.5" step="0.01" value="0.78"></label><label>甩动幅度 <output id="ampValue">100%</output><input id="amplitude" type="range" min="0.2" max="1.3" step="0.01" value="1"></label><label><input id="blood" type="checkbox" checked> 断口血滴</label><label><input id="bones" type="checkbox"> 显示连续骨骼与传递方向</label><small>65 个连接节点 · 同一张素材蒙皮<br>仅为独立预览，未接入游戏。</small></aside></main>
<script>window.RIG=__RIG__;window.IMAGE='data:image/png;base64,__IMAGE__';</script><script>__JS__</script></html>
